{
  "comment": [
    "The default offer of the billing engine (products/chargeback/DESIGN.md §22.12).",
    "On its first start against a database whose plans book carries no offer, the engine writes",
    "this offer into the plans book once (store.EnsureDefaultOffer) and records that it did; it never",
    "writes it again and never over anything a sovereign-admin entered.",
    "price_items are the plans book's items: plans, add-ons and the two meters, annual prices exact.",
    "document is the offer exactly as GET /api/v1/public/packages publishes it, built from the offer",
    "published on 20 October 2026. The engine writes the features, cells, package settings and icons",
    "from it; the derived fields (price_month, step_up, includes, included_from) it computes itself,",
    "and the integration test holds the published document equal to this one.",
    "An icon is a file in icons/ of this directory, named by file instead of by its content address."
  ],
